# 统一行尾策略：仓库内一律存 LF，检出时按平台/下列规则还原。
# 目的：消除 core.autocrlf 造成的 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 噪音，
#       以及 .sln / .cmd 等 Windows 工具链文件被改成 LF 后打不开的问题。

# eol=lf 同时锁死"检出方向"：只写 text=auto 时 git 仍可能在 checkout 时按平台
# 输出 CRLF，导致换分支/回退时整文件 diff。锁成 LF 后提交、检出双向一致。
* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- 源码 / 文本：仓库存 LF ----
*.cs        text diff=csharp
*.csproj    text
*.props     text
*.targets   text
*.config    text
*.xml       text
*.resx      text
*.json      text
*.md        text
*.txt       text
*.toml      text
*.ini       text
*.py        text
*.js        text
*.css       text
*.html      text
*.htm       text
*.gitignore text
.gitattributes text

# ---- Windows 工具链文件：必须 CRLF（VS 解决方案 / 批处理）----
*.sln       text eol=crlf
*.cmd       text eol=crlf
*.bat       text eol=crlf
*.ps1       text eol=crlf

# ---- 二进制：禁止任何行尾转换与 diff ----
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.bmp  binary
*.ico  binary
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
*.sys  binary
*.pdb  binary
*.dat  binary
*.zip  binary
*.7z   binary
*.snk  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.mp4  binary
